            "notes": "Runs the self-validation of a LibreNMS installation and reports every check it performs: database schema, dependencies, poller activity, disk space, file ownership and more. Alerts when a validation reports a warning or a failure, for example an outstanding schema update or a poller that stopped running, which LibreNMS itself keeps reporting as a healthy web interface. Runs the validation as the LibreNMS system user. Supports extended reporting via --lengthy. Requires root or sudo.",
